DEPARTMENTAL UNDERTAKING
Suitability of Departmental Undertaking
Undertakings which require utmost secrecy, like in case of strategic
industries like defence and atomic power.
Undertakings which require absolute government control, like in case of
broadcasting (Ministry of Communication such as India Post, All India Radio
and Doordarshan).
Undertakings in which private sector is unable to enter due to huge capital
investment. e.g., iron & steel,etc.
Undertakings in which undertaking is to be used as a source of revenue, like
in case of Indian Railways.
